  "title": "Free-Stand Single or Dual Access Enclosures Enhancement",
  "summary": "Enhanced to support more applications, our A30 enclosures feature sturdy unibody construction and versatile internal mounting options for panel and component mounting flexibility. Now with a universal rating of UL type 12, 3R, and 4, customers can use their single-door enclosures inside or outside, with protection from dirt, dust, oil, and water. The double-door version is rated for UL type 12/3R.What’s new with both single-door and double-door enclosures?",
